        <mxCell id="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-161" parent="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-156" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#7AA116;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.bucket_with_objects;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Verdana;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="S3 · Parquet" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="56" width="54" x="930" y="48" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-162" edge="1" parent="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-156" source="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-157" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontFamily=Verdana;labelBackgroundColor=none;" target="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-159" value="authorizes columns">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-163" edge="1" parent="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-156" source="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-159" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontFamily=Verdana;labelBackgroundColor=none;" target="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-160" value="10 · table metadata">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-164" edge="1" parent="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-156" source="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-160" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontFamily=Verdana;labelBackgroundColor=none;" target="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-161" value="11 · rows">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-130" parent="zBzA2icYMRFcfZYh4mG8-156" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffaf0;strokeColor=#FF9900;rounded=1;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Verdana;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;1 — Kiro calls the gateway&#39;s MCP URL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;2 — With no token, the gateway answers 401 + WWW-Authenticate, which sends the client to Okta&#39;s login page.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;3 — The user signs in with PKCE; Okta&#39;s SPA app returns an access token carrying their groups claim.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;4 — The gateway asks AgentCore Identity to get a downstream token on behalf of that user.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;5 — AgentCore Identity performs the RFC 8693 token exchange against Okta, authenticating as the service app.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;6 — Okta returns the exchanged token: same sub (the user), new cid (the service app) — that pair is what makes it delegation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;7 — The gateway forwards the exchanged token to the runtime, which validates it with its own Okta JWT authorizer.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;8 — identity.py reads the groups claim, maps it to a tier, and calls sts:AssumeRole for that tier&#39;s IAM role.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;9 — The server queries Athena using those temporary credentials, so the query runs as the caller&#39;s role.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;10 — Athena resolves table metadata from the Glue Data Catalog.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;11 — Glue vends credentials for the underlying Parquet in S3 and the rows come back.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
